      clinicalImportance: 'Ultrasound is essential for obstetric imaging, abdominal organ evaluation, cardiac imaging (echocardiography), vascular assessment, and guided procedures. It is safe, non-invasive, radiation-free, and provides real-time imaging, making it ideal for pregnancy and dynamic studies.',
